\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  The blood of Jesus was poured out
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 in the garden in his sweat
\par and when he was whipped severely
\par and was giv'n a crown of thorns
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par He was nailed at his feet and hands
\par and from them He bled so greatly
\par and the spear wound at his side
\par made him bleed profusely too
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Jesus said that his blood is for
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 the new covenant because
\par it was shed for many people
\par for forgiveness of their sins
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par His body is as good a food
\par Drinking of His blood gives us life
\par He who eats and drinks of it
\par inherit eternal life.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.   It was Jesus' blood that was used
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 so to pacify our God
\par and was made for drinking only
\par a remedy for our sins
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par It is like a heavenly dew
\par It is like life's springing water
\par The blood of mediator
\par is what I shall always praise
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.   This very blood strengthens those
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 who are tired and very sad,
\par It shows us that Jesus loves us
\par and gave up Himself for us
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par as payment for what'er we owe
\par so I highly value His blood
\par and with faith I hold it fast
\par and am satisfied within.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Jesus came and made an off'ring
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 without any blemishes
\par and as a result of that it
\par could also cleanse our conscience
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Because of Jesus God loves us
\par He erased our debts completely
\par and because of His love too
\par we shall do our Saviour's will.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. We entrust our flesh and spirit
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 to the hands of Jesus Christ
\par Just as he gave himself to us
\par we place ourselves in His stead
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par When we shall depart from here
\par We shall by the power of His blood
\par Leave this earthly journey here
\par \pard      to where He forever lives.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

